@Tangem is a hardware wallet that keeps your private keys inside a secure chip on the card. 

The key is created on the card and never leaves it, so it is not exposed to your phone or the internet.

Its seedless option means you do not have to write down a 12- or 24-word recovery https://t.co/WIX1w1Hikm
